==Trivia==
* The [[Black mask]] is the cause of the scream's unique damage type.{{CiteNPC |npc=Cavey Davey |quote=Well, ye see them Jungle Horrors? Well down in the caves there be Cave Horrors. They are bigger, badder, meaner, and have a howl that freezes the blood in yer veins. Wearin' earmuffs or a helmet won't work, cos them masks they wear make the sound magical. Only thing that works is wearin' a Witchwood Icon.}}
* The five variants of cave horror are functionally identical, but have slightly different sizes and appearances. Their names as defined in the game's source code suggest they perform different roles in cave horror society: <code>harmless_island_cave_horror_worker</code>, <code>...young_worker</code>, <code>...guard</code>, <code>...small_guard</code>, and <code>...alpha</code>.
* The guard variants wear a necklace of skulls, whereas the alpha variant wears a necklace of small bones.

